# Kind $20's guard with $07 bit 4 (Kind20Carrier, $83:9AC9) and its pot (kind
# $42, Kind42Start $83:C5DE), which no level places: on the first level
# the guard at record $0BAB is put back in its start state ($0C) with $07
# bit 4 set. The guard moved to x $0090 with $07 $10 (facing right, the
# pot's $07 0: it rolls), the floor at x $0100-$011F emptied (level tile
# words $7F2380, $7F2382 made $1140, an empty tile) and Aladdin at x $00E0:
# it throws; 24 frames on Aladdin is put at x $0040, behind it, so the pot
# passes him and tells the guard (its $4F 2), which turns red and charges
# (Kind20Spotted). The pot lands, rolls, drops into the gap
# ($83:C672), rolls on and breaks at the wall ahead (Kind42Break).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 40,00
poke 0019E5 40,00
poke 7F2380 40,11
poke 7F2382 40,11
poke 000BB7 90,00
poke 000BB2 10
poke 000BAB 0C
wait 5
poke 0008E7 E0,00
poke 0008EA B0,01
wait 24
poke 0008E7 40,00
wait 200
